    {
      "id": "73a8c88f-cae1-45cf-8c8e-0ce9694a5f28",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -48,
        -912
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1148,
        "height": 836,
        "content": "# Automate LinkedIn event outreach with Periodix Actions and AI\n\nThis is a meetup agent for events your team is attending, or any industry event worth showing up to. It finds people who post that they are personally planning to attend an event on LinkedIn, not just posts that mention the event in passing, then checks which of them also fit your ICP. Only people who show real intent to attend AND match your ICP get a personalized connection note built from what they actually said about going.\n\n### How it works\n1. Periodix Actions searches LinkedIn posts for your event keyword and returns authors.\n2. Authors are deduped and filtered by your ICP keywords in the headline or company.\n3. AI reads each post and headline to judge two things at once: does the post show the author's own intent to attend (not a promo or organizer post), and does the person fit your ICP. Anyone without real attendance intent is scored low regardless of ICP fit.\n4. Cold leads (below threshold, or no real intent to attend) go straight to the Cold sheet, no further cost.\n5. Hot leads get a connection note drafted from that same post, built around their specific reason for attending, not a generic ICP pitch.\n6. Hot leads land in the Hot sheet with score, reason, and a ready note.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the Periodix Actions node: a verified n8n community node for LinkedIn and Sales Navigator that works on both n8n Cloud and self-hosted. \nSign up at actions.periodix.net and connect a LinkedIn profile.\n2. Fill Event Config: event keywords, ICP keywords, ICP description, offer, and score threshold.\n3. Add your AI provider credential to both AI nodes (Claude by default, OpenAI or Gemini also work).\n4. Connect Google Sheets with Hot and Cold tabs.\n\n### Customization\nScoring cheaply on intent and ICP together, then drafting straight from the same post, cuts AI and API cost roughly 80% versus enriching everyone upfront. \nPeriodix Actions connects through LinkedIn's own infrastructure, not a browser scraper: no cookies, no CAPTCHA, no per-actor Apify subscription. \nBuilt on the infrastructure behind Periodix (rated 4.9/5 on G2): 0 LinkedIn accounts lost across 25,000 connected profiles in the last 24 months. Pricing starts at $10/month per profile with 1,000 results included, or $49/month unlimited."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
